{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026c4O0u04P3p1794904034.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>袁偉豪（Ben）與張寶兒（Bowie）的細仔「袁氹氹」日前迎來1歲生日，張寶兒特別在社交平台上載一段溫馨慶生短片，記錄一家人齊心合力為細仔製作生日蛋糕的歡樂時刻，場面溫馨爆燈！</p><p></p><p>從片中可見，3歲的大仔「袁咕碌」化身小廚師，全程投入地與爸爸媽媽一起製作蛋糕，動作有板有眼，盡顯哥哥風範。隨後，父子倆在焗爐前滿懷期待地等待蛋糕出爐，畫面極具愛意。期間更發生了一幕搞笑插曲，張寶兒突然驚覺製作蛋糕時忘記加蛋，一旁的袁偉豪隨即露出一副「習慣了」的表情，夫妻倆的幽默互動令人忍俊不禁。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"7e70fb6f-ebc6-4bef-b11f-decdba861247.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026hZhiH0hWqM1794904033.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"b4ff6934-6044-457c-924e-2e4eb3fbfd8f.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026eYFbPNrzIm1794904033.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"28b0a339-623c-4bf2-996a-823a0364230a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026oM9Ssyjb6d1794904033.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>最後，一家四口圍在愛心蛋糕前齊唱生日歌，祝賀1歲的袁氹氹生日快樂。懂事的袁咕碌更非常有禮貌地逐一叫齊「公公、婆婆、爸爸、媽咪、弟弟食蛋糕」。張寶兒亦在帖文中大讚大仔的表現，感性留言道：「袁咕碌很開心地承擔起了哥哥的角色，和我們一起將全部的愛，濃濃地傾注進了這塊蛋糕。原來幸福可以這麼具體，愛是給予，是分享，是流動。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.791376+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":396,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:50.824379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:24:59.083042+00:00","content_hash":"41380c7e5572f4f95859313bf7b0658b5289ed52ba4f6df204c2fea0cac78edf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.791376+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}